": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q7v2W9Bo_yQQ7kNvwFe6Xwj&_nc_oc=AdrTjLpMShHAdzOochKLjuEGxWmuY5c1PEbmPhwxEPwq998xqGIQyabdODUDmMVDbjY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1V2p1KImdljksYsHuW7IA0mRrRsirYyDgL1ESldQ6r7Q&oe=69F2171C"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X6EPQuxRhU4Q7kNvwFXZAJ-&_nc_oc=AdoZK4e1OIYj5r7-drDzs1rsSqKPduilxj7xQoAx2oAEznWgIFkVfLEHMRly8b_jkh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af277Ed4_SLe5L9HijZiRUymShkLT-36y-he2Qx8AQ6Xnw&oe=69F1F1A5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y5L36CTg90cQ7kNvwFWULF0&_nc_oc=AdpTGBTbB22eSzMX3zMpZ1QHdvql8etQqWI9-c6ckPw9u9IlCYnEqJTmKiFEl5AbjyA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af36DFRwG9BbdgBLIxPEZfIBuotwpQH7aMw2V74P7lbTzQ&oe=69F1E5EC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F59Ad6FWFqMQ7kNvwGIXYkM&_nc_oc=AdqikP6PyjK763djMlMUmx3I-u3dEzTcrDNOeji0NFKbB6h2518ZC8HnIkF0bNzrBkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1H5ILd7mOrIRbFkJoc1jmBW370FGaffWDZpCYsMS9uMg&oe=69F1EBAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D1kXhZaWSL4Q7kNvwFP9VNj&_nc_oc=AdqV_9aTaaw0I78HFbIzcFUaHZFr0CwAFdZSpY47D8cpYyD2ZPfPVegEDZ8kYbmasso&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af10hpDuvd7JRcLBXknb_7kwKyL0OR_pZayxcmMDHDt5Mw&oe=69F20B56"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Big Sugar", "support_website_url": "https://happygiant.com/#contact", "we